                <invention-title lang="en">TRANSMISSION PREEMPTION CONTROL FOR ENHANCED COMPONENT CARRIERS</invention-title>
            </bibliographic-data>
            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>A method for wireless communication at a user equipment, UE, comprises receiving, from a base station, a time division duplexing, TDD, configuration of designated downlink symbols, designated uplink symbols, and flexible symbols, which may be switched to be uplink or downlink symbols. The method further comprises receiving, from the base station, in an allocation of uplink or downlink resources an indication to switch the flexible symbols to be uplink or downlink symbols, and communicating with the base station based on the designated downlink symbols, the designated uplink symbols, and the flexible symbols based at least in part on the indication.</p>
            </abstract>
